璧十雙，車馬百駟。髡辭而行，至趙。趙王與之精兵十萬，革車千乘。楚聞之，夜引兵而去。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji126-002:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p003","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"趙王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0180","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"明示封拜與文獻用稱分開；未知授任年及終點保持未知，不以死亡自動終止官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p003","text":"威王八年，楚大發兵加齊。齊王使淳于髡之趙請救兵，齎金百斤，車馬十駟。淳于髡仰天大笑，冠纓索絕。王曰：「先生少之乎？」髡曰：「何敢！」王曰：「笑豈有說乎？」髡曰：「今者臣從東方來，見道傍有禳田者，操一豚蹄，酒一盂，祝曰：『甌窶滿篝，汙邪滿車，五穀蕃熟，穰穰滿家。』臣見其所持者狹而所欲者奢，故笑之。」於是齊威王乃益齎黃金千溢，白璧十雙，車馬百駟。髡辭而行，至趙。趙王與之精兵十萬，革車千乘。楚聞之，夜引兵而去。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n